{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16224230","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16224230","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1622423001:1":{"text":"Thank goodness it's okay. Thanks, really. I need to calm it down first.","source_cn":"还好这些小家伙没事，谢谢各位，我得先去安抚它们的情绪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1664BC003BBC6624","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1622423002:1":{"text":"Bur gives you a quiet nod, then turns away to tend the shaken chick.","source_cn":"布尔向你们轻轻点头致意，随后便转身去安顿受惊的幼鸟。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0E034671B7D0E0BA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Bur gives you a quiet nod, then turns away to tend the shaken chick.","female":"Bur gives you a quiet nod, then turns away to tend the shaken chick.","variant_male_record_index":"216104","variant_female_record_index":"216105","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1622423003:1":{"text":"You saved us from disaster and brought the chick back. We can't thank you enough.","source_cn":"真是太感谢了！如果不是你们出手，真不知道会发生什么无法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9F6EE40674A036B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1622423004:1":{"text":"Hepler doesn't answer. He turns to leave.","source_cn":"赫普没有回应瑟卡，而是转身准备离开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00249B7E815D799E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1622423005:1":{"text":"Please wait! Lord Woodkeeper! I know we embarrassed ourselves in front of you...","source_cn":"请等一下！林息者大人！我……我知道我们的争执很愚蠢，让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87F392187762ABAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1622423006:1":{"text":"I told you. You've mistaken me for someone else.","source_cn":"我说了，你认错了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFA496A06993EA35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1622423007:1":{"text":"Maybe I have. But still...","source_cn":"好吧，就当是我认错了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E6C53D53D67677D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1622423008:1":{"text":"You stepped in when we had no chance. I have a favor to ask. Please save our lead bird!","source_cn":"可您刚才替我们解了围，我还有一个请求……请您再救救我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48FFB5EE6A04AA9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1622423009:1":{"text":"He's badly hurt and barely breathing. We don't know what to do...","source_cn":"它伤得非常非常重，现在气息微弱……鸟群不知道该怎么办……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F67AF88E71B9B2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1622423010:1":{"text":"A flock's survival can't hang on one life. I won't intervene. It just doesn't work that way.","source_cn":"鸟群的生存，不会系于某一个个体。我不能为它治疗，这不是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x726FA95079E54289","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1622423011:1":{"text":"B-But the lead bird carries our <style=\"highlight\">path memory</style>—the route passed down through generations. He is the only one who knows the way.","source_cn":"可是……可是头鸟身上承载着族群代代相传的<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB244004A75EBF969","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1622423012:1":{"text":"Without it... we will be lost!","source_cn":"要是头鸟死了，我们将彻底失去方向！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9C9795CE6960F4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1622423013:1":{"text":"No. Migratory birds will never be lost in the sky. But survival demands payment. Sometimes the payment is a life.","source_cn":"不，翱翔在天空中的候鸟永远不会迷失方向。不过付出一些代...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA84FE6256A2E6D38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1622423014:1":{"text":"You may hate it, but it's the truth.","source_cn":"这很残酷，但我还是要告诉你们这一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x631759695DED471C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1622423015:1":{"text":"Now, I'm leaving.","source_cn":"好了，回去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FF841AAC79F7479","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1622423015":{"text":"Now, I'm leaving.","source_cn":"好了，回去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FF841AAC79F7479","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1622423016:1":{"text":"End of discussion.","source_cn":"这件事免谈。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x17EECC6F4C2DFA70","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"End of discussion.","female":"End of discussion.","variant_male_record_index":"216119","variant_female_record_index":"216120","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1622423018:1":{"text":"Just... point us somewhere. A suggestion, a hint—anything! Please... I'm so lost.","source_cn":"……能给我们一点指示吗？什么都好！我真的……不知道接下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A284A3D5424E2B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1622423019:1":{"text":"Hepler's downright refusal hits Serka hard, but there's no anger in him. He just keeps pleading, reaching for anything that might save them.","source_cn":"赫普的坚决让瑟卡深受挫折，但它并未流露不满，反而更像一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50DFA3099F7FD7D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1622423020:1":{"text":"There's confusion in Serka's gaze, and grit beneath it. Something in Hepler loosens.","source_cn":"望着瑟卡那双写满迷茫却依然坚韧的眼睛，赫普的态度似乎有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4FC9890C24FAEDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1622423021:1":{"text":"Think about what your <style=\"highlight\">ancestors</style> told you.","source_cn":"去回想你们<style=highlight>先祖的遗训...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8DEB42500E615B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1622423022:1":{"text":"Our ancestors' words...?","source_cn":"……先祖的遗训？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2907AA87B19D07A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1622423023:1":{"text":"That's the only guide you actually need.","source_cn":"那才是你们真正需要的指引。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1F125D74D46BF92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:0:1":{"text":"We're just leaving?","source_cn":"真的不帮它们吗","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3D17FF638B1AF55E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We're just leaving?","female":"We're just leaving?","variant_male_record_index":"86161","variant_female_record_index":"86162","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1622423017:1":{"text":"No buts.","source_cn":"没有可是。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF898D7ED05295C5D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"No buts.","female":"No buts.","variant_male_record_index":"216121","variant_female_record_index":"216122","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:1:2":{"text":"But...","source_cn":"可是……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBA4E001A4D450BC3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"But...","female":"But...","variant_male_record_index":"86163","variant_female_record_index":"86164","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:布尔":{"text":"Bur","source":"布尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"Narrator","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瑟卡":{"text":"Serka","source":"瑟卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:赫普":{"text":"Hepler","source":"赫普","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":27,"localized_text_count":26,"speaker_count":4}}